 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yuFodWP6Eo4Q7kNvwGn96_t&_nc_oc=AdqeO8psU2MG2WsRcq-9IOjLsPRLNx_LsKQ4LwRcHHtD2BH7XdHj6bpjykDEp_uXb-E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQILil5LBLOOKDm8nbQttO8B2MgbDzSOjEEwiunsb7wmkw&oe=6AAD5641"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l6jFZ2W6Ac8Q7kNvwGHTsJB&_nc_oc=AdoDrRLK4zfNuGUehO7yG7qnm4H9F70PPlWmn7va2Vd8rIn5TQdj4E2aRdYBSuVuJyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJv7GGAtYAQF2pbLvZcdN6LRUjAi5C9307toCYq6mdyuw&oe=6AAD63A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=C1t_qXd4VLcQ7kNvwE-uPJ9&_nc_oc=AdreLd3II07TB7yBsBDRdrZZy2Wo0fr68Z8IQ9zAWN0vm-rAF6Eqhh6XYW3vJG2hPBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK0tPBsAp9XNaRcoEx2dgYe_FPhkmmvBbbD_7VO0kaWPA&oe=6AAD355C"}, {"fil